      <p source="#source-645-1250"><seg source="#source-645-702">今日も鬱陶しき天気に御座候。愈御佳安奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-702-714">レ</note><seg source="#source-714-834">賀候。然れば昨日官長罷出、茂田君と御約定申上候通、今廿七日英国水師提督に対面之儀</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-834-855"><rb>者</rb><rt>（は）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-855-864">、第十</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-867-912"><seg source="#source-864-867">字</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-888-897">（時）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-912-945">より彼船に御同行申度奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-945-957">レ</note><seg source="#source-957-1017">存候間、此段御通達申上候。当方へ御入来被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1017-1029">レ</note><seg source="#source-1029-1056">下候や。又当方より</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1056-1089"><rb>罷出</rb><rt>（まかりいで）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1089-1092">可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1092-1104">レ</note><seg source="#source-1104-1134">申や。御返事此者へ為</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1134-1146">二</note><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1146-1176"><rb>御聞</rb><rt>（おきかせ）</rt></ruby><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1176-1188">一</note><seg source="#source-1188-1191">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1191-1203">レ</note><seg source="#source-1203-1212">下度如</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1212-1224">レ</note><seg source="#source-1224-1250">此御座候。以上。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1250-1333" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
